# Kaya, Spirits' Justice's +2: "Surveil 2, then exile a card from a graveyard." (CR 701.25, 608.2c) The surveil finishes first: it looks at
# Mox Sapphire and Mox Ruby (the top two), puts Mox Sapphire into the graveyard and keeps Mox Ruby on top, and only then does Bot1 choose which
# card in any graveyard to exile: the Mox Sapphire that was just put there (Black Lotus, in the graveyard too, stays). Loyalty 3 -> 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Kaya, Spirits' Justice
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Island x4
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kaya, Spirits' Justice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Kaya, Spirits' Justice.Activate(Ability: +2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Mox Ruby | Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Sapphire)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Kaya, Spirits' Justice.Counters.Loyalty = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Exile = Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
Stack.Count = 0
